      "requiresWorkflowSuccess": [],
      "semantics": "Final existing gated-publisher step rechecks local and remote eleven-asset SHA256/size identities, exact five npm SHA512 versions, root latest and source/tag. Refuses newer published products or Latest; only writes the selected release ID via PATCH draft=false/prerelease=false/make_latest=true, then rechecks all inputs and observes both publication and Latest. Already promoted state is read-only on retry, even after loss of the journal. Does not create a tag, upload/replace assets, mutate npm or deploy the website/app. The participating Latest-repair workflow shares the publisher concurrency group; manual/API writers remain outside that lock."
    },
