      "requiresWorkflowSuccess": [],
      "semantics": "Consumes five already qualified tarballs without repacking/installing. Requires exact source/tag, names/versions, SHA512 registry integrity and exact four-platform root pins. Only version-endpoint 404 is absence. Publishes missing platform packages via the existing ci.yml OIDC identity, then waits for all four exact public versions before root/latest publication. Rechecks root channel to avoid stale promotion and refuses unsupported automatic dist-tag repair; per-platform convenience tags are not product qualification. Attempt journal records accepted commands but every success requires live public metadata. Does not dispatch workflows or promote GitHub/app/website pointers."
    },
