      "semantics": "Uses already gated local product bytes. Resolves the existing product tag to the exact source, creates only a draft if GitHub returns 404, checks all eleven installer assets by exact size/SHA256, and uploads only missing assets without clobber or deletion. Retry rechecks remote state independently of the local progress journal. Conflicting/incomplete existing assets fail closed; a published release is read-only and must already be complete. Does not execute a build, advance Latest, publish npm or replace upstream product acceptance. No workflow-success lookup beyond existing job prerequisites."
    },
