      "semantics": "Consumes explicit historical handoff and native-inspection control run/attempt/artifact/source pins. Fetches immutable IDs with bounded digest checks; stages all nine roles, reconstructs numerical evidence, checks exact npm/SEA/browser bytes and native Mac observation against independent signer/verifier policy. Dedicated isolated source clone; clone-local generated-output excludes and journals outside it preserve clean-source checks. No producer build/install or tag mutation. Read-only permissions, no protected environment or OIDC token; publish_prepared=false returns after full authentication and never calls a publisher. A successful local result is not an independent release attestation."
